This one springs from my inordinate fondness for PUNS...

     Monster name:        Sword Swallower
     Armor class:	  Whatever (fairly high)
     Attacks:		  The usual unarmed bite/claw/kick or whatever.
     Special abilities:   Creature dexterously avoids being hit by
			  deep-throating swords (other weapons hit normally).
			  If player attacks with a sword and misses,
			  random chance of losing weapon:

			  "The Sword swallower swallows your sword!"

     Unique qualities:    Corpse contains increasingly digested weapon
			  which surfaces only if corpse is eaten.
			  usual progression over N turns from rusty
			  through thoroughly rusty to just plain gone.

Something about that fateful message brings a lusty, evil chuckle to me
every time I imagine seeing it mid-battle.


